<div class="mb-6">
  <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-navy">Welcome, <%= user.name %> 👋</h1>
  <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">You are signed in as Super Administrator.</p>
</div>

<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-6">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 border-l-4 border-blue-500">
    <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy">0</div>
    <div class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">Students</div>
  </div>
  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 border-l-4 border-green-500">
    <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy">0</div>
    <div class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">Teachers</div>
  </div>
  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 border-l-4 border-purple-500">
    <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy">0</div>
    <div class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">Parents</div>
  </div>
  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 border-l-4 border-gold">
    <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy">0</div>
    <div class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">Classes</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-6">
  <h2 class="font-bold text-navy mb-2">🎉 Welcome to your Admin Portal!</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">
    This is where you'll manage students, teachers, parents, classes, fees, results, and everything else.
    The real features will be added in the next milestones.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-gold">
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
      <strong>Next up:</strong> Student Management — a full CRUD system to add, edit, and view students.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
